                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd89f16b-6ba1-300a-af12-092c322b6015",
                        "entry_id": "3cdff202-4ece-3330-b58e-f17698218eee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Rare au sens littéral Qu’on ne peut décrotter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                        "entry_id": "3cdff202-4ece-3330-b58e-f17698218eee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui persiste dans ses erreurs ou ses défauts."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "938c1b51-8313-47e1-afd0-702d5e912be5",
                                "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                                "text": "L’homme du bout de la table aurait très bien pu passer pour la réalisation vivante du personnage créé, selon eux, par l’indécrottable superstition du personnel de l’Opéra."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33b285e7-91af-4fb0-abcb-ba9789743bd8",
                                "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                                "text": "— L’élève Chalumot fait preuve, en travaux pratiques comme en conduite, d’une indécrottable mauvaise volonté…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea75126d-5444-445c-ae9a-db66520a60a0",
                                "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                                "text": "Je reçois aujourd’hui une édition du Dictionnaire philosophique de Voltaire, et c’est là que je trouve le traité du gros bon sens, plat, d’une indécrottable médiocrité. J’ai rarement lu un livre plus désespérant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c64a0e6-11f6-409b-ba2c-4d3e61d2966c",
                                "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                                "text": "Il faut être sacrément naïf – ou d’une indécrottable mauvaise foi – pour penser que Me Hussain a utilisé l’analogie du nazisme sans arrière-pensée !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c399a2f4-4700-465e-b6af-6db0174c64df",
                                "sense_id": "f8a4d4f4-cf83-300a-b423-a1d01bff4feb",
                                "text": "Les conséquences sociales de la crise ? « Terrible, terrible, terrible. » Liliane a beau être une optimiste indécrottable, elle secoue la tête."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d486370-8a96-4115-831d-2a4be582281f",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cdff202-4ece-3330-b58e-f17698218eee",
                        "target_lang_word": "unverbesserlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unverbesserlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8c345bf-60e8-30cf-bba7-578f116b9dba",
                                        "entry_id": "0b8d762d-08fd-3228-b608-4df28bdf1f3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "durch nichts von seiner Haltung/Meinung abbringbar"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f757b2d-addb-42e9-9c01-292466b97ad5",
                                                "sense_id": "c8c345bf-60e8-30cf-bba7-578f116b9dba",
                                                "text": "„Nur ein unverbesserlicher Egoist kann den Fesseln entgehen, die ihm durch einen ungleichen Partner auferlegt werden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17256525-4bc0-376f-879a-b30c4d688ca8",
                                        "entry_id": "0b8d762d-08fd-3228-b608-4df28bdf1f3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "keine Aussicht auf Besserung/Heilung gewährend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dcb5c07-75b9-4072-ba34-25715c4e66c9",
                                                "sense_id": "17256525-4bc0-376f-879a-b30c4d688ca8",
                                                "text": "„Den Aufklärern indes und den Philanthropen war - in ihrem Glauben an die Möglichkeit für jeden Menschen, sein Leben vernünftig zu führen - die Unvernunft des Irren und sein Wahnsinn ein ideologisches Ärgernis und sein bis dahin unverbesserlicher Zustand eine praktische Herausforderung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d18cd006-4dab-47a6-b3c6-c53099331625",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cdff202-4ece-3330-b58e-f17698218eee",
                        "target_lang_word": "hopeless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hopeless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25d64132-22ae-3531-9129-1127a7886c2f",
                                        "entry_id": "681fad9f-afa0-3021-8ce3-1965512c44a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without hope; despairing; not expecting anything positive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec91d8aa-d483-46e2-9bfe-dedf222291ec",
                                                "sense_id": "25d64132-22ae-3531-9129-1127a7886c2f",
                                                "text": "I am a woman, friendless, hopeless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5311c26a-8486-4b35-8b67-eed5ecd6b86f",
                                                "sense_id": "25d64132-22ae-3531-9129-1127a7886c2f",
                                                "text": "And he a prince; To marry him is hopeleſſe;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a659b37-6c96-43d8-a17b-1a5ba21b521c",
                                                "sense_id": "25d64132-22ae-3531-9129-1127a7886c2f",
                                                "text": "Edward Churchill still attended to his work in a hopeless mechanical manner like a sleep-walker who walks safely on a well-known round. But his Roman collar galled him, his cossack stifled him, his biretta was as uncomfortable as a merry-andrew's cap and bells."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11094e1e-c762-41db-9e6b-f439e7a81fcb",
                                                "sense_id": "25d64132-22ae-3531-9129-1127a7886c2f",
                                                "text": "A gaoler struck him, pushing him back in place in the hopeless, helpless line of prisoners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "703c5eed-589e-31d0-a382-ecfb6305592d",
                                        "entry_id": "681fad9f-afa0-3021-8ce3-1965512c44a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Giving no ground of hope; promising nothing desirable; desperate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e75fa5f6-0366-4909-be73-b1ecf0f7f4a5",
                                                "sense_id": "703c5eed-589e-31d0-a382-ecfb6305592d",
                                                "text": "a hopeless cause"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "434fc87c-39cf-3d28-85ed-6bd7811fe27f",
                                        "entry_id": "681fad9f-afa0-3021-8ce3-1965512c44a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without talent, not skilled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c66c73d-6e1a-4e6c-9c59-1e5500bdb302",
                                                "sense_id": "434fc87c-39cf-3d28-85ed-6bd7811fe27f",
                                                "text": "He's a hopeless writer, but can draw very well."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96efa358-1d8b-4d5c-92a5-eaac9ce40f5e",
                                                "sense_id": "434fc87c-39cf-3d28-85ed-6bd7811fe27f",
                                                "text": "\" It is a pure waste of time.\" \"Not at all,\" Malone answered. \"It has ventilated an evil. There were reporters in court. Surely some of them have some sense. They will note the injustice.\" \"Not they,\" said Mailey. \"The Press is hopeless. My God, what a responsibility these people take on themselves, and how little they guess the price that each will pay! I know.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6858fd74-4599-398b-9671-9d18fe5e348b",
                                        "entry_id": "681fad9f-afa0-3021-8ce3-1965512c44a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incurable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of an adverse condition"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c246f1-f6e1-4fc1-a9e8-54721dcde50c",
                                                "sense_id": "6858fd74-4599-398b-9671-9d18fe5e348b",
                                                "text": "She is a hopeless romantic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70bec790-c03d-4de7-b1f3-175eea5c01b6",
                                                "sense_id": "6858fd74-4599-398b-9671-9d18fe5e348b",
                                                "text": "He is a hopeless idler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
